{"id":"shift_euclidean_distance","title":"Shifted Euclidean","family":"sliding","definition":"reference","intro_en":"Shifted Euclidean evaluates sqrt(sum of squared overlap errors) after each permitted integer shift, using only samples that overlap. This example admits lags from minus three to plus three samples, leaving at least seven paired observations. The animation shows the actual overlap pairs and candidate scores before selecting their minimum.","intro_zh":"Shifted Euclidean 在每个允许的整数平移后，仅对重叠样本计算对应分数。本例滞后范围为 −3 至 +3 个采样点，始终保留至少七对观测。动图展示实际配对和候选分数，再选择最小值。","steps_en":["Fix the permitted lags and minimum acceptable overlap before scoring.","At each lag, compute sqrt(sum of squared overlap errors) on the actual paired samples.","Record every candidate score together with its lag.","Choose the minimum overlap score."],"steps_zh":["先固定允许滞后与最小可接受重叠长度。","对每个滞后的实际配对样本计算对应分数。","记录所有候选分数及其滞后。","选取最小重叠分数。"],"formula":"min_{lag=-3,...,3} ||x_overlap-y_overlap||_2","caveats_en":["The unnormalized total can favour lags with fewer overlapping points.","The bounded window is an explicit demonstration choice; allowing every possible lag changes the problem.","Overlap cropping removes unmatched endpoints from this score."],"caveats_zh":["未归一化总量可能偏向重叠点较少的滞后。","有界窗口是明确的演示选择；允许所有滞后会改变问题。","重叠裁剪会从分数中排除未匹配的两端。"],"sources":[{"label":"Imported registry: overlap-based shift definitions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"},{"label":"SciPy: euclidean","url":"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.spatial.distance.euclidean.html"}],"x":[1.0,1.1,1.8,3.1,2.4,1.3,0.8,0.9,1.1,1.0],"y":[1.0,1.025244129544237,1.0272789228047705,1.104233600241796,1.7772959251407623,3.071232271760106,2.3916175350540323,1.3197095979615636,0.8296807473987015,0.9123635545572527],"input_label":"Deterministic synthetic illustration; sample index is the time axis.","parameters":{"lags":[-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3],"minimum_overlap"